ing do not edit game files or stage the preview. Generation opens a resizable, copyable report, which can be hidden with Show unlock log. It records the seed, difficulty, first region/store country, coverage warnings and changed/unchanged/skipped totals. Each truck lists its before/after preview rank, file and original ranks, and the reason for its result, including equal random draws, missing tiers/ranks and exclusions from starter coverage. UnlockByExploration=true keeps a truck store-locked until discovered on a map; rank changes do not clear that separate requirement.
 
